 "_about": "The systems the game is made of — the ROWS of the coverage map (tools/coverage-map.mjs). Hand-grouped, but the atoms are derived: every soak EFFECTS id, every pendingChoice modal, every QUESTS id and every ENCOUNTERS id must belong to exactly one system or the tool lists it as unmapped. verbs/rooms/npcs are the atoms a coverage record can touch (a persona 'walked' a system when their record intersects them). Grow the table when a system ships; the guard says when. ALIASES: a ledger row's `system` may be a free word from triage; `aliases` maps each onto a row id, and tests/js/systems.test.js fails on a row whose system is neither (2026-10-21 — a thousand findings had been filed under sixty names the map could not join).",
